flowchart TD
    A[Untrusted or unauthorized request] --> B[Adobe Campaign nlserver web]
    B --> C{Child process created?}
    C -->|No| D[No process-rule alert]
    C -->|Yes| E{Suspicious child or command?}
    E -->|No| F[Retain for baseline]
    E -->|Yes, Windows| G[Windows STRICT alert]
    E -->|Yes, Linux| H[Linux STRICT alert]
    G --> I[Validate process tree and Campaign build]
    H --> I
    I --> J{Approved exact activity?}
    J -->|Yes| K[Document and tune narrowly]
    J -->|No| L[Escalate and contain]
    L --> M[Collect Campaign, proxy, EDR, DNS, and firewall evidence]
    M --> N[Eradicate, patch, and recover]

